== The Expedition

#story(
  "Wave 1 — The Expedition",
  [
    Beyond the quarry's familiar terraces, the old routes open. The expedition sets out from *Elgado*, a stronghold on the cold frontier, where a crimson glow has begun to bleed into the hills — the mark of the *qurio*, a curse that drives monsters into maddened, afflicted states.

    The rookie who survived the quarry now walks among veterans. New weapons, new techniques, new monsters wearing the affliction like a crown. This wave is not about learning to hunt anymore — it is about learning to hunt *deliberately*: reading the monster before it moves, building for the fight instead of against it, and treating every system in the game as a tool with a purpose.

    The expedition does not ask you to be stronger. It asks you to be *better*.
  ],
)

=== Wave 1 Goals

- Start a fresh save and push into Master Rank — the expansion's full game.
- Master *Switch Skills* and *Scroll Swap* — two loadouts in one hunt.
- Learn to read monsters at the level where you stop trading hits and start dictating them.
- Build sets deliberately: skills, decorations, talismans — the economy of power.
- Learn the Sunbreak systems: followers, afflicted monsters, and the first taste of Qurio Crafting.
